<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Täglicher Verkaufsbericht - {{formatDate reportDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #17a2b8;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .kpi-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .kpi-box {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            border-left: 4px solid #17a2b8;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .kpi-number {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #17a2b8;
        }
        .kpi-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .comparison {
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-top: 5px;
        }
        .positive { color: #28a745; }
        .negative { color: #dc3545; }
        .neutral { color: #6c757d; }
        .table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
            background-color: white;
        }
        .table th,
        .table td {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }
        .table th {
            background-color: #17a2b8;
            color: white;
        }
        .highlight {
            background-color: #e7f3ff !important;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }
        .section {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        .chart-placeholder {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border: 2px dashed #dee2e6;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #6c757d;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>📊 Täglicher Verkaufsbericht</h1>
        <p>{{formatDate reportDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}} - Proviantomat Netzwerk</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <div class="kpi-grid">
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{totalRevenue}} €</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Gesamtumsatz</div>
                <div class="comparison {{#if (gt revenueChange 0)}}positive{{else}}{{#if (lt revenueChange 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}{{/if}}">
                    {{#if (gt revenueChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{revenueChange}}% vs. Vortag
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{totalTransactions}}</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Transaktionen</div>
                <div class="comparison {{#if (gt transactionChange 0)}}positive{{else}}{{#if (lt transactionChange 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}{{/if}}">
                    {{#if (gt transactionChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{transactionChange}}% vs. Vortag
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{averageTransaction}} €</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Ø Transaktionswert</div>
                <div class="comparison {{#if (gt avgTransactionChange 0)}}positive{{else}}{{#if (lt avgTransactionChange 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}{{/if}}">
                    {{#if (gt avgTransactionChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{avgTransactionChange}}% vs. Vortag
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="kpi-box">
                <div class="kpi-number">{{activeLocations}}</div>
                <div class="kpi-label">Aktive Standorte</div>
                <div class="comparison neutral">
                    von {{totalLocations}} Standorten
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>🏆 Top 5 Standorte nach Umsatz</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Rang</th>
                        <th>Standort</th>
                        <th>Umsatz</th>
                        <th>Transaktionen</th>
                        <th>Ø Wert</th>
                        <th>Veränderung</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each topLocations}}
                    <tr {{#if (eq @index 0)}}class="highlight"{{/if}}>
                        <td>{{add @index 1}}</td>
                        <td>{{locationName}}</td>
                        <td>{{revenue}} €</td>
                        <td>{{transactions}}</td>
                        <td>{{averageValue}} €</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt changePercent 0)}}positive{{else}}{{#if (lt changePercent 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt changePercent 0)}}+{{/if}}{{changePercent}}%
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>🥇 Top 5 Produkte nach Verkaufsmenge</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Rang</th>
                        <th>Produkt</th>
                        <th>Verkaufte Menge</th>
                        <th>Umsatz</th>
                        <th>Standorte</th>
                        <th>Trend</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each topProducts}}
                    <tr {{#if (eq @index 0)}}class="highlight"{{/if}}>
                        <td>{{add @index 1}}</td>
                        <td>{{productName}}</td>
                        <td>{{quantity}} Stk.</td>
                        <td>{{revenue}} €</td>
                        <td>{{locations}}</td>
                        <td class="{{#if (gt trend 0)}}positive{{else}}{{#if (lt trend 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}{{/if}}">
                            {{#if (gt trend 0)}}📈{{else if (lt trend 0)}}📉{{else}}➡️{{/if}}
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>⏰ Verkäufe nach Stunden</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Zeitraum</th>
                        <th>Transaktionen</th>
                        <th>Umsatz</th>
                        <th>Anteil</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each hourlyData}}
                    <tr {{#if (gte percentage 15)}}class="highlight"{{/if}}>
                        <td>{{timeRange}}</td>
                        <td>{{transactions}}</td>
                        <td>{{revenue}} €</td>
                        <td>{{percentage}}%</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        {{#if alerts}}
        <div class="section" style="border-left: 4px solid #dc3545;">
            <h3>⚠️ Wichtige Hinweise</h3>
            <ul>
                {{#each alerts}}
                <li>{{this}}</li>
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="section">
            <h3>💰 Zahlungsmethoden</h3>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Zahlungsmethode</th>
                        <th>Transaktionen</th>
                        <th>Umsatz</th>
                        <th>Anteil</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each paymentMethods}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{method}}</td>
                        <td>{{transactions}}</td>
                        <td>{{revenue}} €</td>
                        <td>{{percentage}}%</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3>📈 Vergleich mit Vorwoche</h3>
            <div class="kpi-grid">
                <div class="kpi-box">
                    <div class="kpi-number {{#if (gt weeklyRevenueChange 0)}}positive{{else if (lt weeklyRevenueChange 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                        {{#if (gt weeklyRevenueChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{weeklyRevenueChange}}%
                    </div>
                    <div class="kpi-label">Umsatz vs. Vorwoche</div>
                </div>
                <div class="kpi-box">
                    <div class="kpi-number {{#if (gt weeklyTransactionChange 0)}}positive{{else if (lt weeklyTransactionChange 0)}}negative{{else}}neutral{{/if}}">
                        {{#if (gt weeklyTransactionChange 0)}}+{{/if}}{{weeklyTransactionChange}}%
                    </div>
                    <div class="kpi-label">Transaktionen vs. Vorwoche</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Dieser Bericht wurde automatisch vom Proviantomat-System generiert.</p>
        <p>Berichtszeitraum: {{formatDate reportDate "DD.MM.YYYY"}} 00:00 - 23:59 (Europe/Berlin)</p>
        <p>Generiert am: {{formatDate sentAt "DD.MM.YYYY HH:mm"}} (Europe/Berlin)</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>